<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 633 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 633 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totalled 633 contracts compared with 580 overnight Monday, according to the CBOT.</p>
<p>There were 13 wheat, 107 corn, 480 soybean, seven soymeal, and 22 soyoil contracts traded..</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was 1-1/4 cent higher, corn was 1/4 one cent lower to 1/4 higher and soybeans were 2-3/4 to 1-1/4 cents lower.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
